        "number" : 2,
        "step" : "Remove the cauliflower from the blender and place in a cloth.Squeeze out as much water as possible until the cauliflower is as dry as possible.Then, in a bowl, place the cauliflower, egg, flour, salt, pepper, mixed herbs and garlic powder."
